warning[SCXML038]: xpath syntax error in `cond`: unknown XPath function `length()`
 --> tests/ui/scxml038-xpath-unknown-function.scx:8:34
  |
8 |     <transition event="go" cond="length($user/name) &gt; 0" target="b"/>
  |                                  ^^^^^^ unknown function
  |                                  ------------------------- while parsing this `cond`
  |
  = note: a condition that cannot be parsed raises `error.execution` and evaluates as false, so this condition can never hold
  = help: XPath has no `length()`; use `string-length()` (characters in a string) or `count()` (nodes in a node-set)
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §5.9 Expressions
  = spec: SCXML CR 2014 §C.3 The XPath Data Model
help: use `count()`
  |
8 |     <transition event="go" cond="count($user/name) &gt; 0" target="b"/>
  |                                  ~~~~~
help: use `string-length()`
  |
8 |     <transition event="go" cond="string-length($user/name) &gt; 0" target="b"/>
  |                                  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~

